@meta
id: 22-15
title: Append after the column
chapter: 22
type: lesson
skills: visual-block, block-append
par: 33
minutes: 5
vscode: Alt+click after each comma, type, then fix the header by hand
open: orders.csv

@brief
`I` inserts at the left edge of a block. `A` appends at its right edge,
on every line, with the same one-line-until-`Esc` behaviour. Between
them they put text at any column in any number of lines.

The orders export has lost its `year` column. It goes back between
`order_id` and `customer`: every data row gets `2024,` after the order
id, and the header gets `year,` in the same place. The order ids are
all eight characters, so the comma after them is one column all the
way down — which is what makes this a block job. The header is one
line and gets typed by hand.

@keys
| `Ctrl-V` | start a block |
| `A` | append after the right edge of the block, on every line |
| `f,` | find the comma |

@hints
Skip the header. On the first data row, `f,` puts you on the comma;
that comma is the block, one column wide, five `j` tall.
--
`A` then `2024,` then `Esc`. The text lands after the comma on every
row.
--
`j`, `f,`, `Ctrl-V`, `5j`, `A2024,`, `Esc`. Then `gg`, `f,`, `ayear,`,
`Esc` for the header.

@solution
    j f , Ctrl-V 5 j A 2024, <Esc> g g f , a year, <Esc> :wq<Enter>

Twenty-eight keystrokes for six rows, and the same twenty-eight for six
hundred. The block was the comma column: `A` appends after the block's
right edge, and since the block was one wide, that is after the comma.

If the block had been wider — say you had selected the whole id — `A`
would still append after its right edge, so a block does not need to
be exact, only to end in the right column. What it does need is
alignment. Where the lines are ragged, `A` still appends at the block's
column and pads shorter lines with spaces to get there. The next lesson
is for that.

@start orders.csv
order_id,customer,total
ord_1042,priya,48.00
ord_1043,marco,12.50
ord_1044,lena,7.25
ord_1045,tomasz,119.00
ord_1046,aisha,64.10
ord_1047,ben,3.99

@expected orders.csv
order_id,year,customer,total
ord_1042,2024,priya,48.00
ord_1043,2024,marco,12.50
ord_1044,2024,lena,7.25
ord_1045,2024,tomasz,119.00
ord_1046,2024,aisha,64.10
ord_1047,2024,ben,3.99
